a around Fekola.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/b2gold-corp-btg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BTG 2019 Q2","e":"btg","d":"2019-08-07","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Cinnamond","x":"We experienced cost savings in a number of areas, including drilling and blasting, so the backfill areas, which didn't require blasting, and we also had blast pattern spacing, which was increased, resulted in savings in drill meters and blast stages.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/b2gold-corp-btg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BTG 2019 Q2","e":"btg","d":"2019-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Cinnamond","x":"And overall, we're maintaining guidance for both operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/b2gold-corp-btg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BTG 2019 Q2","e":"btg","d":"2019-08-07","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Cinnamond","x":"And then, Limon, still maintaining guidance at 55,000 to 60,000 ounces weighted to the second half based on the timing of Central ore processing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/08/08/b2gold-corp-btg-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BTG 2019 Q4","e":"btg","d":"2020-02-28","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Mike Cinnamond","x":"So as you may recall from our disclosure previously we -- that restructuring of our interest in Nicaragua was for proceeds of $100 million plus working capital adjustments and included in that -- and so that resulted of because we had that in -- that was finalized in October, we booked that gain…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/02/28/b2gold-corp-btg-q4-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"BTG 2019 Q4","e":"btg","d":"2020-02-28","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Mike Cinnamond","x":"Overall, it gave us more ounces than we planned and that beat the upper-end -- the 456,000 ounc